  "why": "F354 and the dual-emitter pairing: two equal words of the bundle's dual emitter inside 150 ms share one shot_group, a third word past the window starts a new one, an EMP word between a damaging word and its `$HP` leaves the damage with the damaging word, and a drop with no word inside 1000 ms books no hit.",
